Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The search will continue,\Nbut let's suspend it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We must let it decide its own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll observe it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,then combine it with JoJo Kujo's memories\Nfor everyone to find out the real truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This weird little fruit baby probably\Nabsorbed the bone when it was germinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And Palesnake is here somewhere inside\Nthis prison to find out what's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What will come out of this pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here because he wants to know\Nwhat begins when it's finally born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go find the main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you do, blow him off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way worse than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That disgusting troll hit my face with\Nhis foul poisonous drool before I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my mouth is half gone, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Little or little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go after Jolene's boat? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan was to go find that\NStan's user and assassinate him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so goddammit I'm sticking to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way it gets done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play. Let's\Ngo outside. Let's go, go 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,2, 3, come and find a\Nway. I'm only— I am only
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up and don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.14,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I'm going to die,\NI don't stop bleeding,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop bleeding, don't\Nstop bleeding, I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,this might be a silly question but\Nwhy'd you make him stop the boat here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,now quick turn off the engine and keep\Nquiet listen do you hear something
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you to turn off the engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up, affoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Abnormal conditions traced in\Nall disciplined cell zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Security now set to level\Nfour in entire complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alertness is at max priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A 12.7 millimeter heavy machine gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Operational distance range\Nis 1,000 to 2,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were barely grazed\Nby one of those bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,both our limbs and this\Nboat would be shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quiet down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll break the steering wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If they knew we were here, there\Nwould already be a hail of gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,At your tent, I just saw a ripple\Nin the water by that grove.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a fish or Cutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're headed right to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take these leaves, Master,\Nyou'll be able to make a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to keep your trap shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, these, you don't understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this frond and fold it in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You weave the leaflets, then\Nyou place it up against here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You then secure it with\Na stock, take the sap,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and smear it on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go, now everybody's\Nready for the plan, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go back. This isn't standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,protocol must be pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you heard him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, holy shit, it's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the engine up and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be dead before it even spins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crap did you pull\Nup to discipline cells, scumbags?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where we can see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down in the ground and\Ndon't try anything funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you giant freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna get shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we can borrow one of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And by we, I mean you. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that just now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be taking this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The crocodiles are hungry,\Nso try not to get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, are you okay with plants?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep heading towards the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's getting low.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so brutal, treating\Nme like a base object.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, may I ask you\Nto stop that whistling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I find it highly irksome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,those guards might come after us and I\Nwant to keep an ear out for their engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My voice is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy stealing the\NGreen Child and escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,with it wasn't his only goal here he was
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,secretly attacking us are you feeling all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,right your breathing is\Nvery erratic and shallow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So is mine, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel my rapid heartbeat\Nsuddenly being so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you fully understand\Nmy feelings for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my eyes, my tongue! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you\Ncan't find any words?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that feeling all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But words are unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I feel the exact same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to kiss me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the type where our\Ntongues join in sultry tango?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When and how did that creature attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We clearly need to watch him every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to kiss or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is this an indication that you're\Npartial to more unorthodox proclivities?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you prefer to kiss\Nlike a contortionist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an automatic pursuit-style stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He obediently follows\Norders like a slave and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,grovels at your feet to\Nseem harmless and pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, that's his\Neffed-up little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a stand that specifically waits for\Nthe moments when we're most off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he strikes automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll both be dead if\Nwe don't do something
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, my back is turned.\NNow try attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need Anastasia to notice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, ma, that is my name, and\Ndon't you forget it. Yeah, yeah, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what happens when\Nyou lick a frog's skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You make a gooey liquid made of a delicious\Ncombination of lard, blood, and brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then rub it all over your\Nskin, your entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wonderful beauty secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives you superior hydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you desire, I can catch ten more and\Nmake you a mini skirt out of the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't mind me saying so, I\Nwould be incredibly honored to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make your legs look\Nvery long and slender
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,your calves shapely and your butt perky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, tell me if\Nthere's something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If a trigger is really necessary here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,then it makes sense that there'd\Nbe a trigger to his attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, if they're\Nlaunched automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I was waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I stretched my thread over my skin\Nand waited for something to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When I look away, that's when\Nthe automatic attack starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his power, hitting\Nat your weakest point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But also, I figured out a\NSinks method, mosquitoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, what's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, was I wrong about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not only mosquitoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, he's obviously got other ways to\Nhit us besides those blood-sucking bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I continue driving\Nus back to supposed safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you prefer to fight with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One-on-one, as the expression goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you like to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The mosquitoes are just part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell else\Nis he going to let loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing something horrible to us\Nthat we can't even see! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You might like to know, I believe this is\Nthe very last chance you have to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, wretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for your\Nsingle greatest regret,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were shat out into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the back of the boat, in\Nthe port side corner. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take out everything\Nyou've been hiding from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to lay it out\Non my feet and show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No funny business!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I have two beetles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also a karaoke mic, packets of\Nsugar substitute, and these three frogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have a raw frog skin one\Nhead of broccoli and four mock
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,strawberries and two used matches\Nand that's everything I promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as creepy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're upwind of him, but\Nsomething is still attacking us
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it though?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So you embody an automatic\Npursuit stand then which means
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever your attack target is it\Nhas to be fixed You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely fixed ever since\NI first touched Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So with Jolene as the target,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you were ordered by your\Nuser not to run away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,or in fact do anything else,\Nuntil she's been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya-ya-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're planning\Nto stay by her side,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there's something\Nyou should know, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That would leave me with no other\Nchoice but to finish you off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it a spit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya, ya, Ma, do you still not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can destroy or stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you'll have\Nto get used to the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There was only ever one way either of\Nyou were going to survive this trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and that was to escape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, you have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're gonna have\Nto stop this boat and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All that foamy spray flying up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's mixed his nasty saliva\Nhe used to attack us before
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,with the marsh water we're\Nnow getting splashed with,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, stand up and get\Nyour ass in the driver's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the boat go faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me? Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Higher speed creates more spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, we'll melt\Nlike hot wax in minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, most certainly, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do precisely as you have asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like he's no longer attacking us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,despite the fact that he\Nclearly hasn't sped up the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,S-something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.11,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Discus birds! Hide! Hide! Freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what\Nhis attack methods are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this scaly, wretched freak is\Na perfect automatic pursuit stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply implanted a frog into his brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and subsequently attached its\Nbrain right to his pursuit sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, just like a frog,\Nhe'll be in perpetual pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I am an automatic pursuer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to kill Jolene Kujo\Nand abscond with the Green Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been derailed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to disseminate my spit\Nspray and attack Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rub some plastic onto the\Npropellers to create static electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and its resistance will scatter\Nmy spit flex everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He can try, but he'll\Nnever figure this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't get past my fear of the birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.59,0:16:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Must get away from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wet myself, just like a frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful body that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to catch you! Ooh! A beetle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's safe to\Nleave him alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get back to\NFF and heal your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, we must wait for\Nthem to take out D and G and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? I've seen\Ncrazy shit in here, but
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing like this where did\Nthe guards and prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,go they're just gone\Nit's only been 10 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and what are these are\Nthere actual trees growing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,in here all of a sudden\Nhow are we supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,report this and what's the\Ndeal with him can he not
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,talk or what he's prisoner\Nnumber me 14067 he goes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By D and G, his forearm is\Njust blood and bone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hanging by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in no shape for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some balls sending in\Na gross, creepy stand like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So is payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's some FF ammo for your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Father Poochie, the prison chaplain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they bring him here for\Nthat bastard's last rites?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him. Just focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important thing right now\Nis making sure D &G is dead as dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,359.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,367.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,373.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,379.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,383.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,389.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,397.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The 300s are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the 400s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with 401.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,409.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since D &G is injured to within a mere\Nhair's breadth of bleeding to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that can only mean that somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolincuja is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the massive amount of those\Nwithered and rotting plant remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I surmise, must be due to the\Npresence of Dio's bone buried within.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, Dio's bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,employ the prisoners' bodies to instigate\Na movement that's beyond my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We should celebrate that\Nthis has finally begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For 22 years, I have awaited this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything and everything D &G saw here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pull out of the\Nman himself while I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Survivor's Guccio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it seems you were\Nwitness to none of the action,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still believe something special\Nwas born from all those plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree that\Nbirthed Voren's rejoicing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will soon belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know the\Ndefinition of true happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,when you hold heaven in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We must praise what has been born unto us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It is heaven embodied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A new world has opened up and I am\Ngoing to be at the vanguard of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give due praise to this deep emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Handel's exquisite messiah,\Na time-honored masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How fitting, a perfect piece, as if\Nthe sounds themselves were aglow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's often said that Handel\Ncontinued to play this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,his own magnum opus until\Nthe day before his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we're gonna leave D &G to the\Nmedics and question them after treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rest of us are going\Nto search for the prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and guards to see where in\Nthe hell they could have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'm going to\Nquestion him before his treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing sight of that newly born miracle\Nwould make me very, very unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's back it out. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize the face\Nhiding under that hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this, pal! You should know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,users with automatic pursuit stands are\Ndefenseless when under counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the risk you take!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was right! FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she at this discipline cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long? Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going after TNG!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Snake is here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Which direction did he\Nthrow that damn disc from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,479, 487, 491, 499.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's who threw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is troublesome indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're currently here planning\Nto unceremoniously eliminate DNG,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,then that must mean his stand, Yayama,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,is simultaneously after\NJolene's life, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortuitous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to ask him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His death would be quite\Nproblematic, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me\Nthat Pale Snake is really...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so what are you going to do if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I then immediately\Nbecome top priority?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will finishing off DMG\Nstill take precedence over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father, Poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place Other than he
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering About my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.56,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.44,0:23:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.58,0:24:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
